  - Welcome, brave wizard! You can use "Space" to see next page.
  - In these dark realms, perilous secrets await you. Gather the ancient runes and
    face the dark sorcerer! Your journey will require courage, wisdom, and mastery
    of powerful spells.
  - Go forth, and let your adventure begin! But remember, every step will test your
    wits and bravery.
  - You have to find 2 runes go find them!
  - If you die, game over be carefull!
  - Good luck!
